sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Bunny user process
  participant K as Linux kernel
  participant R as Broker
  participant L as logind
  participant P as Polkit
  B->>K: connect AF_UNIX
  K->>R: SO_PEERCRED PID/UID/GID
  R->>R: verify /proc start time, timestamp, nonce, rate
  alt read-only method
    R-->>B: typed machine status
  else mutation
    R->>L: active session check
    R->>P: exact action + PID/start/UID
    P-->>R: authorize or deny
    R-->>B: typed result or safe denial
  end

